flowchart TD
 Owner[Owner and staff: phone or desktop] --> UI[Coverage and attention board]
 Sources[Selected WhatsApp groups / Gmail / uploads] --> Ingest[Connector journal and coverage]
 Ingest --> Assets[Evidence assets and derivatives]
 Assets --> Candidate[Bounded interpretation and matching]
 Candidate --> Review[Matched / ambiguous / unmatched review]
 Review --> Ledger[Accepted records and open commitments]
 Ledger --> Context[Current-grant context assembly]
 Context --> Agent[Bounded harness and model adapters]
 Agent --> Proposal[Typed action proposal]
 Proposal --> Policy[Current policy and exact approval]
 UI --> Policy
 Policy --> Intent[Durable intent and outbox]
 Intent --> Tools[Scoped API or browser adapter]
 Tools --> Receipt[Receipt / failure / unknown]
 Receipt --> Verify[Readback and reconciliation]
 Verify --> Ledger
 Ledger --> UI
 Review --> Change[Fix / instruction / rule / product change]
 Change --> Eval[Protected tests and controlled activation]
 Eval --> Context
